      "message": {
        "format": "html",
        "html": "<style type=\"text/css\">.lettersmith-defaults p,.lettersmith-defaults li{white-space:pre-wrap}.lettersmith-defaults hr{height:1px;border-width:0}.lettersmith-defaults li.unchecked::marker{content:\"\\2610\"}.lettersmith-defaults li.checked::marker{content:\"\\2612\"}</style><div class=\"lettersmith-defaults\"><!-- lettersmith-style-state:v2: -->\n\n<!-- lettersmith-message:v2 -->\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; color:#2b1c12\">Dear </span><a href=\"ultralink:Jennifer%0ACornish%20%2F%20Welsh%0AMeaning%3A%20Commonly%20interpreted%20as%20%22white%20phantom%2C%22%20%22fair%20one%2C%22%20or%20%22white%20wave.%22%0AJennifer%20is%20the%20Cornish%20form%20of%20Guinevere%2C%20derived%20from%20Welsh%20Gwenhwyfar.%20The%20older%20meaning%20is%20generally%20reconstructed%20as%20%22white%20phantom%22%20or%20%22fair%20magical%20being.%22%0A%0AJennifer%20Cruz%20Hernandez%20%E2%80%94%20Symbolic%20interpretation%0AA%20fair%20one%2C%20bearing%20the%20cross%2C%20descended%20from%20a%20courageous%20traveler.%0AThis%20combines%20the%20name%20meanings%20poetically%20rather%20than%20giving%20a%20literal%20translation.\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#00aaff\">Jennifer</span></a><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; color:#2b1c12\"> </span><a href=\"ultralink:Cruz%0ASpanish%20%2F%20Portuguese%0AMeaning%3A%20The%20Cross.%0ADerived%20from%20Latin%20crux%2C%20meaning%20cross.%20As%20a%20surname%2C%20it%20could%20describe%20someone%20living%20near%20a%20cross%20or%20originate%20from%20a%20place%20named%20Cruz.%20It%20also%20has%20Christian%20religious%20associations.\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#aa55ff\">Cruz</span></a><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; color:#2b1c12\"> </span><a href=\"ultralink:Hernandez%20%28Hern%C3%A1ndez%29%0ASpanish%20%2F%20Germanic%20roots%0AMeaning%3A%20Son%20of%20Hernando.%0AHernando%20is%20related%20to%20Fernando%20or%20Ferdinand%2C%20whose%20Germanic%20roots%20are%20commonly%20interpreted%20in%20terms%20of%20courageous%20or%20daring%20journeys.%0AThe%20Spanish%20surname%20ending%20-ez%20indicates%20descent%2C%20traditionally%20%22son%20of.%22\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#ff1553\">Hernandez</span></a><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; color:#2b1c12\">,</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\">Hey <a href=\"ultralink:Jennifer%0ACornish%20%2F%20Welsh%0AMeaning%3A%20Commonly%20interpreted%20as%20%22white%20phantom%2C%22%20%22fair%20one%2C%22%20or%20%22white%20wave.%22%0AJennifer%20is%20the%20Cornish%20form%20of%20Guinevere%2C%20derived%20from%20Welsh%20Gwenhwyfar.%20The%20older%20meaning%20is%20generally%20reconstructed%20as%20%22white%20phantom%22%20or%20%22fair%20magical%20being.%22%0A%0AJennifer%20Cruz%20Hernandez%20%E2%80%94%20Symbolic%20interpretation%0AA%20fair%20one%2C%20bearing%20the%20cross%2C%20descended%20from%20a%20courageous%20traveler.%0AThis%20combines%20the%20name%20meanings%20poetically%20rather%20than%20giving%20a%20literal%20translation.\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:italic; color:#00aaff\">Jennifer</span></a>! I hope you're doing well and that life has been treating you kindly.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\">I just wanted to take a moment to send a little encouragement your way. I hope that wherever life takes you, you continue to find joy in the little things, strength in difficult moments, and peace in knowing that God is always with you.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\">May God continue to guide your steps, bless the work of your hands, and fill your heart with patience, wisdom, and compassion. Never underestimate the difference that a little kindness can make in someone's life or the impact you can have simply by being there for others.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\">Whatever challenges or opportunities lie ahead, I pray that you continue to grow in faith, find fulfillment in all that you do, and trust in the path God has prepared for you.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\"><a href=\"ultralink:%E2%80%94%20Psalm%2023%3A1\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#643f11\">“The Lord is my shepherd, I lack nothing.”</span></a></p></div>",
